    "one_liner": "基于 PyTorch 与 Transformers 的句子嵌入、重排序与稀疏嵌入库，支持从 Hugging Face Hub 加载模型并微调。",
    "ecosystem": "python",
    "bindings": []
  },
  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "sentence-transformers 是一个 Python 深度学习库，围绕 Hugging Face Transformers 与 PyTorch 构建，提供句子/文本嵌入、重排序（Cross-Encoder）和稀疏嵌入（Sparse Encoder）三类模型的加载、推理与微调能力。它通过统一的 API 从 Hugging Face Hub 获取超过 15000 个预训练模型，服务于语义搜索、语义相似度、段落挖掘、信息检索等 NLP/搜索场景。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "句子/文本嵌入",
        "description": "通过 SentenceTransformer 加载预训练 bi-encoder 模型，将文本编码为稠密向量，用于语义搜索与相似度计算。",
        "evidence": [
          "sentence_transformers/sentence_transformer/model.py:SentenceTransformer",
          "sentence_transformers/__init__.py:SentenceTransformer"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "重排序与交叉编码",
        "description": "通过 CrossEncoder 对查询-文档对进行联合编码并输出相关性分数，常用于检索后的二次重排序。",
        "evidence": [
          "sentence_transformers/cross_encoder/model.py:CrossEncoder",
          "sentence_transformers/__init__.py:CrossEncoder"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "稀疏嵌入",
        "description": "通过 SparseEncoder 支持 SPLADE/CSR 等稀疏表示，输出高维稀疏向量用于词汇级检索。",
        "evidence": [
          "sentence_transformers/sparse_encoder/model.py:SparseEncoder",
          "sentence_transformers/sparse_encoder/modules/splade_pooling.py:SpladePooling"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "多模态嵌入",
        "description": "可选支持图像、音频、视频模态，通过 transformers[vision/audio/video] 加载 CLIP、Whisper 等多模态模型进行跨模态编码。",
        "evidence": [
          "pyproject.toml:project.optional-dependencies.image/audio/video",
          "sentence_transformers/base/modules/transformer.py:Transformer docstring"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "模型微调与训练",
        "description": "提供 Trainer、TrainingArguments、多种损失函数与采样器，支持在自定义数据上微调嵌入/重排序/稀疏模型。",
        "evidence": [
          "sentence_transformers/base/trainer.py:BaseTrainer",
          "sentence_transformers/sentence_transformer/trainer.py:SentenceTransformerTrainer",
          "sentence_transformers/cross_encoder/trainer.py:CrossEncoderTrainer"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "推理后端与量化优化",
        "description": "除默认 PyTorch 外，可选 ONNX 与 OpenVINO 推理后端，并提供动态/静态量化与 ONNX 优化导出。",
        "evidence": [
          "sentence_transformers/backend/load.py:load_onnx_model",
          "sentence_transformers/backend/load.py:load_openvino_model",
          "sentence_transformers/backend/quantize.py",
          "sentence_transformers/backend/optimize.py"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Hugging Face Hub 模型加载与缓存",
        "description": "通过 huggingface_hub 下载模型文件到本地缓存，支持版本、子目录与离线加载。",
        "evidence": [
          "sentence_transformers/util/file_io.py:hf_hub_download",
          "sentence_transformers/util/file_io.py:snapshot_download"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "自然语言处理 / 机器学习 / 信息检索",
    "target_users": "Python 开发者、NLP/搜索算法工程师、推荐与检索系统研究人员"
